{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "Necesito la ayuda de alguien más."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "Espero que la Mita de aquí... no muerda..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "Qué perdida de tiempo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "¿Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "Mita, ¡despierta!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "¡Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "Mita, ¡despierta!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "¡Necesito tu ayuda!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "¿Quién ereees?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "Necesito ayuda con las palancas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "¿Palancas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "Por favor... déjame dormir..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "O al menos... tráeme un café."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "¿Un café?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "¿Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "¡Miitaaaa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "Mita,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "aquí tienes tu café."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "Dijiste algo sobre,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "¿unas palancas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "Sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "¿Cómo sabes de ellas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "Aunque... para qué pregunto..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "Considerando que estás aquí,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "ya debes saber bastante..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "Un momento,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "debo sentarme."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "¿Y bien...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "No sé qué decir..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "pero debo seguir avanzando,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "a donde quiera que me guíe el anillo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "Tienes su anillo ¿verdad?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "Ahora entiendo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "cómo encontraste este lugar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "Así es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "Entonces, ¿puedes ayudarme"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "con las palancas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "Está bien."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "Te ayudaré."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "Con esas... paaalaancaaaas..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "Mita, vamos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "vamos de una vez."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "¿Qué?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "Bueno..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "vamos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "Levántate."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "¿Tienes tanto sueño?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "Despierta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "Ya llegamos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "Muy bien,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "estoy lista."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "Yo también."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "Bueno."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "Voy a "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "empezar a contar"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "y jalamos las palancas juntos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "¿entiendes?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "Sólo no te duermas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "Adelante."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "¿Qué estás haciendo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "Vamos,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "de nuevo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "¿Otra vez?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "Ah..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "me estoy..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "durmiendo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "Me duermo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "Funcionó."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "Gracias, Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "Mm-hmm."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "La puerta..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "es muy..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "lenta..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "Buenas noches..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "¿Por qué vamos a la cocina?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "Si me termino durmiendo en el piso frío,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "...será tu culpa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "Oye..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "¿qué palanca necesitas bajar?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "¿No pasó nada?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "Entonces ¿qué hace este botón aquí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "Toma un poco más"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "o te dormirás de vuelta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "¿Qué?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "Noooooo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "este café sabe horriiibleee..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "tranquilo... estoooy muuuy bien..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "¿Mita? El botón no funciona... ¿puedes escucharme?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "¿Hola?"}
